      *>> datamunge::optim::ArbitraryFunction::ArbitraryFunction() ->
      *>>   ARBITRARY-FUNCTION handle with COBOL overrides
      *>> CALL "dm_arbitrary_function_extend" USING
      *>>   DM-ARBITRARY-FUNCTION-EXTEND DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::optim::ArbitraryFunction. Close the
