      *>>   Optimizers that
      *>> consume this type (e.g. SimulatedAnnealing) are
      *>>   derivative-free.
      *>>
      *>> This is a director-enabled extension point: subclass it
      *>>   directly (in C++, or, via
      *>> SWIG directors, in any supported language) to define a custom
      *>>   objective.
