      *>> Override of
      *>>   datamunge::optim::ArbitraryFunction::evaluate(const
      *>>   std::vector<double> & coordinates) -> double: SET it TO
      *>>   ENTRY "PROGRAM-ID", or leave it NULL (required: pure
      *>>   virtual).
          05 DM-ARBITRARY-FUNCTION-EXTEND-EVALUATE USAGE
              PROGRAM-POINTER.
      *>> Result: ARBITRARY-FUNCTION handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-ARBITRARY-FUNCTION-EXTEND-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

