              UNSIGNED.
      *>> coordinates (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE
      *>>   handle.
          05 DM-ARBITRARY-FUNCTION-EVALUATE-COORDINATES USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (double): double.
          05 DM-ARBITRARY-FUNCTION-EVALUATE-RESULT USAGE COMP-2.

