              PROGRAM-POINTER.
      *>> Result: SEPARABLE-FUNCTION handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-SEPARABLE-FUNCTION-EXTEND-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

