      *>> datamunge::bayes::HMC::HMC(HMCOptions options = {}) -> HMC
      *>>   handle
      *>> CALL "dm_hmc_new" USING DM-HMC-NEW DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::bayes::HMC. Close the handle with CALL
      *>>   "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Hamiltonian Monte Carlo with a fixed leapfrog trajectory
      *>>   length and Nesterov
      *>> dual-averaging step-size adaptation during warmup (Hoffman &
      *>>   Gelman 2014), using
      *>> an identity mass matrix. Samples from the distribution
      *>>   proportional to
      *>> exp(log_posterior) over unconstrained real parameters.
      *>>
      *>> Stores the sampler settings.
