      *>> Arguments to send: 0 to 1 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 0.
          05 DM-HMC-NEW-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 0.
      *>> options (HMCOptions = {}): HMC-OPTIONS handle. Sampler
      *>>   settings.
          05 DM-HMC-NEW-OPTIONS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result: HMC handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-HMC-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::bayes::HMC::sample(optim::DifferentiableFunction &
      *>>   log_posterior, const std::vector<double> & initial_params)
      *>>   const -> HMCResult
      *>> CALL "dm_hmc_sample" USING DM-HMC-SAMPLE DM-STATUS
