      *>> CALL "dm_importance_sampling_sample" USING
      *>>   DM-IMPORTANCE-SAMPLING-SAMPLE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> `log_target` need only be evaluable
      *>>   (optim::ArbitraryFunction), not
      *>> differentiable. `proposal_covariance` (a plain d x d nested
      *>>   vector, not
      *>> linalg::DenseMatrix -- matrices never cross the SWIG boundary
