      *>> CALL "dm_boundary_condition1d_type_set" USING
      *>>   DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE DM-STATUS (writes -VALUE)
      *>>
      *>> Supported condition kind; defaults to Dirichlet.
       01 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE.
      *>> Self: the BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D handle.
          05 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (BCType): BC-TYPE value (see the 88 levels).
          05 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE-VALUE USAGE BINARY-LONG
              SIGNED.
             88 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE-VALUE-DIRICHLET VALUE 0.
             88 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE-VALUE-NEUMANN VALUE 1.
             88 DM-BOUNDARY-CONDITION1D-TYPE-VALUE-ROBIN VALUE 2.

