      *>   TRIANGLE

      *>> datamunge::geometry::Triangle::Triangle() -> TRIANGLE handle
      *>> CALL "dm_triangle_new" USING DM-TRIANGLE-NEW DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::geometry::Triangle. Close the handle with
      *>>   CALL "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Three original point indices in counterclockwise order for
      *>>   finite mesh faces.
      *>> Original field layout/defaults are retained. A trace ghost
      *>>   uses c=points.size()
      *>> as a symbolic infinity marker, with a,b the reversed finite
      *>>   hull edge; it is
      *>> never returned by delaunay_triangulation(). No coordinate is
      *>>   constructed for it.
