      *>> ```cpp
      *>> const dm::geometry::Triangle t{0,1,2};std::print("{} {}
      *>>   {}\n",t.a,t.b,t.c); // 0 1 2
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> See also: delaunay_triangulation(), DelaunayInsertion
