      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   DELAUNAY-WORK

      *>> datamunge::geometry::DelaunayWork::DelaunayWork() ->
      *>>   DELAUNAY-WORK handle
      *>> CALL "dm_delaunay_work_new" USING DM-DELAUNAY-WORK-NEW
      *>>   DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::geometry::DelaunayWork. Close the handle
      *>>   with CALL "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Actual seed and cavity operations, excluding validation,
      *>>   sorting and copies.
      *>> A conflict test is either an incircle test on a finite face or
      *>>   an exact
      *>> half-plane test on a ghost. Counters exclude CCW checks on
      *>>   newly created faces,
      *>> between-endpoint comparisons, map operations, allocation,
      *>>   trace copies and final
      *>> sorting. Initial seed plus three ghosts are excluded from
      *>>   creation/removal counts.
      *>> No counts are estimates of time or fixed-predicate internal
      *>>   arithmetic.
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> const auto
      *>>   t=dm::geometry::delaunay_trace({{0,0},{4,0},{4,4},{0,4},{2,2}});
      *>> std::print("{}
