      *>> Self: the EXTENDED-KALMAN-FILTER handle.
          05 DM-EXTENDED-KALMAN-FILTER-PREDICT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::filter::ExtendedKalmanFilter::update(const
