              SIGNED.
      *>> blue (int): int. Blue channel, conventionally 0-255.
          05 DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE-BLUE USAGE BINARY-LONG
              SIGNED.
      *>> opacity (double = 1.0): double. Alpha in [0, 1], default 1
