       01 DM-AB-LINE-VERTICAL.
      *>> Self: the AB-LINE handle.
          05 DM-AB-LINE-VERTICAL-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (bool): 0 or 1.
          05 DM-AB-LINE-VERTICAL-VALUE USAGE BINARY-CHAR UNSIGNED.

