          05 DM-PLOT-TITLE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (std::string): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims
      *>>   trailing spaces. Heading text (moved into the plot).
          05 DM-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE PIC X(256).
          05 DM-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              -1.
      *>> Result (Plot &): PLOT handle (new; refers into its owner,
