      *>> datamunge::graphics::Plot::margins(double left, double right,
      *>>   double top, double bottom) -> Plot &
      *>> CALL "dm_plot_margins" USING DM-PLOT-MARGINS DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Overrides the automatic outer margins (in pixels) around the
      *>>   plotting area, e.g. for
