      *>> Self: the PLOT handle.
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> left (double): double. Left margin in pixels (default 90).
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-LEFT USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> right (double): double. Right margin in pixels (default 24).
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-RIGHT USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> top (double): double. Top margin in pixels (default 72, plus
      *>>   24 when a subtitle is set).
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-TOP USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> bottom (double): double. Bottom margin in pixels (default 84).
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-BOTTOM USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result (Plot &): PLOT handle (new; refers into its owner,
      *>>   which it keeps alive). This plot, for chaining.
          05 DM-PLOT-MARGINS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

