          05 DM-PLOT-SAVE-PNG-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> path (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
      *>>   trims trailing spaces. Destination file; an existing file is
      *>>   overwritten.
          05 DM-PLOT-SAVE-PNG-PATH PIC X(256).
          05 DM-PLOT-SAVE-PNG-PATH-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              -1.

