      *>> CALL "dm_plot_save_pdf" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE-PDF DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Writes to_pdf() to `path` regardless of its extension.
      *>>
      *>> Errors (a non-zero status):
      *>> - std::runtime_error: If the file cannot be written or
