      *>>
      *>> See also: save(), to_pdf()
       01 DM-PLOT-SAVE-PDF.
      *>> Self: the PLOT handle.
          05 DM-PLOT-SAVE-PDF-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> path (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
