      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> auto plt = dm::Plot(dm::c(1.0, 2.0, 3.0), dm::c(2.0, 4.0,
      *>>   8.0))
      *>>                .set_title("Growth")
      *>>                .set_subtitle("Doubling every step")
      *>>                .set_xlab("Step")
      *>>                .set_ylab("Count");
      *>> std::print("{} / {}\n", plt.title_text(),
      *>>   plt.subtitle_text());
      *>> // Growth / Doubling every step
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> See also: set_subtitle(), set_xlab(), set_ylab(), dm::title()
