          05 DM-R-PLOT-POINTS-COLORED-MARKER-SIZE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result (RPlot &): R-PLOT handle (new; refers into its owner,
      *>>   which it keeps alive). This plot, for chaining.
          05 DM-R-PLOT-POINTS-COLORED-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::graphics::RPlot::line(std::vector<double> x,
      *>>   std::vector<double> y, std::string label = "", RGBA color =
      *>>   ..., double stroke_width = 2.0) -> RPlot &
