          05 DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-H-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 1.
      *>> y_value (double): double. Height of the line, in data units.
          05 DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-H-Y-VALUE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> color (RGBA): RGB handle. Line color (default opaque black).
          05 DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-H-COLOR USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> stroke_width (double = 1.0): double. Line width in pixels
      *>>   (default 1).
