      *>> Self: the R-LAYOUT handle.
          05 DM-R-LAYOUT-TO-PNG-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::uint8_t>): VECTOR-UCHAR handle (new;
      *>>   close it). The complete PNG file contents.
          05 DM-R-LAYOUT-TO-PNG-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::graphics::RLayout::to_pdf() const ->
      *>>   std::vector<std::uint8_t>
