      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   DTW-COMPUTATION

      *>> datamunge::geometry::DTWComputation::DTWComputation() ->
      *>>   DTW-COMPUTATION handle
      *>> CALL "dm_dtw_computation_new" USING DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-NEW
      *>>   DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::geometry::DTWComputation. Close the
      *>>   handle with CALL "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Owned ordinary result and logical work, without retained
      *>>   cost-table history.
      *>> Scratch consists of two cost rows and one predecessor byte per
      *>>   positive cell.
      *>> No input references survive return. Copies own independent
      *>>   result paths.
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> const auto
      *>>   c=dm::geometry::dynamic_time_warping_work({0,1},{0,1});
      *>> std::print("{} {}\n",c.result.distance,c.work.cells); // 0 4
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> See also: dynamic_time_warping_work(), DTWTrace
       01 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-NEW.
      *>> Result: DTW-COMPUTATION handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> DTWResult datamunge::geometry::DTWComputation::result
      *>> CALL "dm_dtw_computation_result_get" USING
