      *>> CALL "dm_dtw_computation_result_set" USING
      *>>   DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-RESULT DM-STATUS (writes -VALUE)
      *>>
      *>> Optimal path and its unnormalized absolute loss.
       01 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-RESULT.
      *>> Self: the DTW-COMPUTATION handle.
          05 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-RESULT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (DTWResult): DTW-RESULT handle (new; refers into its
      *>>   owner, which it keeps alive).
          05 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-RESULT-VALUE USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> DTWWork datamunge::geometry::DTWComputation::work
      *>> CALL "dm_dtw_computation_work_get" USING
      *>>   DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-WORK DM-STATUS (reads -VALUE)
      *>> CALL "dm_dtw_computation_work_set" USING
      *>>   DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-WORK DM-STATUS (writes -VALUE)
      *>>
      *>> Actual recurrence and traceback counts.
       01 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-WORK.
      *>> Self: the DTW-COMPUTATION handle.
          05 DM-DTW-COMPUTATION-WORK-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (DTWWork): DTW-WORK handle (new; refers into its owner,
