      *>> datamunge::LinalgMatrix::multiply(const LinalgMatrix & other)
      *>>   const -> LinalgMatrix
      *>> CALL "dm_linalg_matrix_multiply" USING
      *>>   DM-LINALG-MATRIX-MULTIPLY DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Form a lazy matrix product, fusing preceding inverse actions
      *>>   into a solve.
      *>> An expression solve(A) * B * C evaluates B * C before one
      *>>   native solve.
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> dm::LinalgMatrix A({1, 2}, 1, 2), b({3, 4}, 2, 1);
      *>> std::print("{:.0f}\n", A.multiply(b).values()[0]); // 11
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> Errors (a non-zero status):
      *>> - std::invalid_argument: If inner dimensions differ.
       01 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-MULTIPLY.
      *>> Self: the LINALG-MATRIX handle.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-MULTIPLY-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> other (const LinalgMatrix &): LINALG-MATRIX handle. Right
      *>>   operand, retained by shared ownership.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-MULTIPLY-OTHER USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (LinalgMatrix): LINALG-MATRIX handle (new; close it).
      *>>   Deferred product or solve handle.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-MULTIPLY-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LinalgMatrix::inverse_action() const ->
      *>>   LinalgMatrix
      *>> CALL "dm_linalg_matrix_inverse_action" USING
      *>>   DM-LINALG-MATRIX-INVERSE-ACTION DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Form a deferred square inverse action, without factorisation
