       01 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-INVERSE-ACTION.
      *>> Self: the LINALG-MATRIX handle.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-INVERSE-ACTION-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (LinalgMatrix): LINALG-MATRIX handle (new; close it).
      *>>   Deferred inverse-action handle.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-INVERSE-ACTION-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LinalgMatrix::solve(const LinalgMatrix & rhs) const
      *>>   -> LinalgMatrix
      *>> CALL "dm_linalg_matrix_solve" USING DM-LINALG-MATRIX-SOLVE
