          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-SOLVE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> rhs (const LinalgMatrix &): LINALG-MATRIX handle. Matrix of
      *>>   right-hand sides with rows() rows.
          05 DM-LINALG-MATRIX-SOLVE-RHS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (LinalgMatrix): LINALG-MATRIX handle (new; close it).
