       01 DM-ACOR-OPTIONS.
      *>> Self: the ACOR handle.
          05 DM-ACOR-OPTIONS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (const ACOROptions &): ACOR-OPTIONS handle (new; refers
      *>>   into its owner, which it keeps alive). The stored options.
          05 DM-ACOR-OPTIONS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

