          05 DM-ADAM-OPTIONS-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> double datamunge::optim::AdamOptions::step_size
      *>> CALL "dm_adam_options_step_size_get" USING
      *>>   DM-ADAM-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE DM-STATUS (reads -VALUE)
      *>> CALL "dm_adam_options_step_size_set" USING
      *>>   DM-ADAM-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE DM-STATUS (writes -VALUE)
      *>>
      *>> Fixed learning-rate/initial search step; use the objective
      *>>   scaling stated by optimize(). Default 0.001.
