      *>> CALL "dm_bayesian_surrogate_fit" USING
      *>>   DM-BAYESIAN-SURROGATE-FIT DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Fits the surrogate to the observations so far.
       01 DM-BAYESIAN-SURROGATE-FIT.
      *>> Self: the BAYESIAN-SURROGATE handle.
          05 DM-BAYESIAN-SURROGATE-FIT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> points (const std::vector<std::vector<double>> &):
      *>>   VECTOR-VECTOR-DOUBLE handle. Evaluated points, one per
