      *>>   DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Minimizes `function` within [`lower_bound`, `upper_bound`],
      *>>   updating
      *>> `coordinates` in place to the best point found, and returns
      *>>   its value. The
      *>> initial `coordinates` (clamped into bounds) seed one parent of
      *>>   the population.
