              UNSIGNED.
      *>> function (ArbitraryFunction &): ARBITRARY-FUNCTION handle.
          05 DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE-FUNCTION USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> coordinates (std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE handle.
          05 DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE-COORDINATES USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> lower_bound (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE
      *>>   handle.
          05 DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE-LOWER-BOUND USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> upper_bound (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE
      *>>   handle.
          05 DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE-UPPER-BOUND USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (double): double.
          05 DM-EVOLUTION-STRATEGY-OPTIMIZE-RESULT USAGE COMP-2.

