      *>   FISTA-OPTIONS

      *>> datamunge::optim::FISTAOptions::FISTAOptions() ->
      *>>   FISTA-OPTIONS handle
      *>> CALL "dm_fista_options_new" USING DM-FISTA-OPTIONS-NEW
      *>>   DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::optim::FISTAOptions. Close the handle
      *>>   with CALL "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Configuration for FISTA; fields retain their documented native
      *>>   defaults.
      *>> Supply finite values in the supported ranges. Controls are
      *>>   copied at construction;
      *>> validation, stopping and loss scaling belong to optimize().
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> dm::optim::FISTAOptions o;
      *>> std::print("{}\n",o.max_iterations); // 10000
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> See also: FISTA
       01 DM-FISTA-OPTIONS-NEW.
