      *>> C++ class datamunge::optim::HarmonySearch. Close the handle
      *>>   with CALL "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> Harmony search on an ArbitraryFunction within a box
      *>>   constraint: a fixed-size harmony
      *>> memory of candidate solutions is improvised one new vector at
      *>>   a time, mixing memory
      *>> consideration, pitch adjustment, and random selection per
      *>>   dimension, with greedy
      *>> replacement of the worst memory member. Derivative-free.
