      *>>   returned point.
          05 DM-SIMULATED-ANNEALING-OPTIMIZE-COORDINATES USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (double): double. Objective at the native returned
      *>>   coordinates; not a stop-status code.
          05 DM-SIMULATED-ANNEALING-OPTIMIZE-RESULT USAGE COMP-2.

