      *>> Result (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE handle
      *>>   (new; close it). A vector of length p; the AR polynomial is
          05 DM-ARIMA-AR-COEFFICIENTS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

