      *>> datamunge::stats::ARIMA::log_likelihood() const -> double
      *>> CALL "dm_arima_log_likelihood" USING DM-ARIMA-LOG-LIKELIHOOD
      *>>   DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Gaussian log-likelihood at the CSS estimate, over n_used()
      *>>   residuals.
      *>>
      *>> `-\tfrac{n}{2}(\log 2\pi + \log\sigma^2 + 1)` with `n` =
      *>>   n_used().
