              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::pair<std::vector<double>, std::vector<double>>):
      *>>   -FIRST: VECTOR-DOUBLE handle; -SECOND: VECTOR-DOUBLE handle.
      *>>   A pair (point forecasts, standard errors), each of length
