      *>>   DM-EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING-OPTIONS DM-STATUS
       01 DM-EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING-OPTIONS.
      *>> Self: the EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING handle.
          05 DM-EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING-OPTIONS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (const ExponentialSmoothingOptions &):
      *>>   EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING-OPTIONS handle (new; refers into its
      *>>   owner, which it keeps alive).
          05 DM-EXPONENTIAL-SMOOTHING-OPTIONS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

