          05 DM-SPLOM-LEVEL-PALETTE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> colors (const std::vector<datamunge::graphics::RGB> &):
      *>>   VECTOR-RGB handle. Fill colors in sorted-level order,
