      *>> datamunge::Splom::show_grid(bool enabled = true) -> Splom &
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_show_grid" USING DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Toggles the light background grid of the scatter and violin
      *>>   panels (default on).
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> auto pairs = dm::Splom(dm::datasets::iris(), {"Sepal.Length",
      *>>   "Sepal.Width", "Species"})
      *>>                  .marker_size(1.5)
      *>>                  .bins(15)
      *>>                  .show_grid(false);
      *>> ```
       01 DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID.
      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Arguments to send: 0 to 1 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 0.
          05 DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 0.
      *>> enabled (bool = true): 0 or 1. True draws the grid.
          05 DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID-ENABLED USAGE BINARY-CHAR UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Splom &): SPLOM handle (new; refers into its owner,
      *>>   which it keeps alive). This matrix, for chaining.
          05 DM-SPLOM-SHOW-GRID-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Splom::variables() const ->
      *>>   std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_variables" USING DM-SPLOM-VARIABLES DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Variable names in panel order.
       01 DM-SPLOM-VARIABLES.
      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-VARIABLES-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::string>): VECTOR-STRING handle (new;
      *>>   close it). A copy of the selected column names.
          05 DM-SPLOM-VARIABLES-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Splom::groups() const -> std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_groups" USING DM-SPLOM-GROUPS DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Sorted group labels set by group_by(), in palette order; empty
      *>>   without grouping.
       01 DM-SPLOM-GROUPS.
      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-GROUPS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::string>): VECTOR-STRING handle (new;
      *>>   close it). A copy of the group labels; also empty after the
      *>>   factor form of set_col().
          05 DM-SPLOM-GROUPS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Splom::title_text() const -> std::string
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_title_text" USING DM-SPLOM-TITLE-TEXT DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> The figure title set by set_title() or title().
