      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-TITLE-TEXT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::string): text in PIC X(16384); -LENGTH is its
      *>>   length in bytes. The title; empty when unset.
          05 DM-SPLOM-TITLE-TEXT-RESULT PIC X(16384).
          05 DM-SPLOM-TITLE-TEXT-RESULT-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED
              VALUE 0.

      *>> datamunge::Splom::width() const -> int
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_width" USING DM-SPLOM-WIDTH DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Figure width in pixels.
       01 DM-SPLOM-WIDTH.
      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-WIDTH-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (int): int. The width (960 by default).
          05 DM-SPLOM-WIDTH-RESULT USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Splom::height() const -> int
      *>> CALL "dm_splom_height" USING DM-SPLOM-HEIGHT DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Figure height in pixels.
       01 DM-SPLOM-HEIGHT.
      *>> Self: the SPLOM handle.
          05 DM-SPLOM-HEIGHT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (int): int. The height (960 by default).
