      *>> CALL "dm_lm_summary" USING DM-LM-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LM-SUMMARY.
      *>> Self: the LM handle.
          05 DM-LM-SUMMARY-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::string): text in PIC X(16384); -LENGTH is its
      *>>   length in bytes.
          05 DM-LM-SUMMARY-RESULT PIC X(16384).
          05 DM-LM-SUMMARY-RESULT-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              0.

      *>> datamunge::LM::print_summary() const -> void
      *>> CALL "dm_lm_print_summary" USING DM-LM-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
