      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   LDA

      *>> datamunge::LDA::LDA(const DataFrame & data, const std::string
      *>>   & formula, const std::vector<double> & priors = {}) -> LDA
      *>>   handle
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_new" USING DM-LDA-NEW DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::LDA. Close the handle with CALL
      *>>   "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::stats::LDA —
      *>>   R-`MASS::lda()`-style linear discriminant analysis.
       01 DM-LDA-NEW.
      *>> Arguments to send: 2 to 3 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 2.
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 2.
      *>> data (const DataFrame &): DATA-FRAME handle.
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-DATA USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> formula (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
      *>>   trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-FORMULA PIC X(256).
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-FORMULA-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              -1.
      *>> priors (const std::vector<double> & = {}): VECTOR-DOUBLE
      *>>   handle. Optional class prior probabilities (must sum to 1,
      *>>   ordered as classes() once sorted alphabetically); pass an
      *>>   empty vector (the default) to use observed class
      *>>   proportions.
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-PRIORS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result: LDA handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-LDA-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::classes() const -> std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_classes" USING DM-LDA-CLASSES DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LDA-CLASSES.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
          05 DM-LDA-CLASSES-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::string>): VECTOR-STRING handle (new;
      *>>   close it).
          05 DM-LDA-CLASSES-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::predictor_names() const ->
      *>>   std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_predictor_names" USING DM-LDA-PREDICTOR-NAMES
      *>>   DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LDA-PREDICTOR-NAMES.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
          05 DM-LDA-PREDICTOR-NAMES-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::string>): VECTOR-STRING handle (new;
      *>>   close it).
          05 DM-LDA-PREDICTOR-NAMES-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::observations() const -> std::size_t
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_observations" USING DM-LDA-OBSERVATIONS DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LDA-OBSERVATIONS.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
          05 DM-LDA-OBSERVATIONS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::size_t): unsigned long.
          05 DM-LDA-OBSERVATIONS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::num_discriminants() const -> std::size_t
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_num_discriminants" USING DM-LDA-NUM-DISCRIMINANTS
