      *>> Result (DataFrame *): DATA-FRAME handle (new; refers into its
      *>>   owner, which it keeps alive).
          05 DM-LDA-CONFUSION-MATRIX-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::summary() const -> std::string
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_summary" USING DM-LDA-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LDA-SUMMARY.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
          05 DM-LDA-SUMMARY-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::string): text in PIC X(16384); -LENGTH is its
      *>>   length in bytes.
          05 DM-LDA-SUMMARY-RESULT PIC X(16384).
          05 DM-LDA-SUMMARY-RESULT-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              0.

      *>> datamunge::LDA::print_summary() const -> void
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_print_summary" USING DM-LDA-PRINT-SUMMARY
      *>>   DM-STATUS
       01 DM-LDA-PRINT-SUMMARY.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
