      *>> datamunge::LDA::to_md(int digits = 4) const -> std::string
      *>> CALL "dm_lda_to_md" USING DM-LDA-TO-MD DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> The fit as Markdown tables (priors, group means, coefficients,
      *>>   proportion of trace).
       01 DM-LDA-TO-MD.
      *>> Self: the LDA handle.
          05 DM-LDA-TO-MD-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
