          05 DM-LDA-TO-MD-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 0.
      *>> digits (int = 4): int.
          05 DM-LDA-TO-MD-DIGITS USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::string): text in PIC X(16384); -LENGTH is its
