      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   KNN-CLASSIFIER

      *>> datamunge::KNNClassifier::KNNClassifier(const DataFrame &
      *>>   data, const std::string & formula, std::size_t k = 5, const
      *>>   std::string & metric = "euclidean", bool weighted = false,
      *>>   bool standardize = true) -> KNN-CLASSIFIER handle
      *>> CALL "dm_knn_classifier_new" USING DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW
      *>>   DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::KNNClassifier. Close the handle with CALL
      *>>   "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::stats::KNNClassifier —
      *>>   k-nearest-neighbors classification.
      *>> Since a training point's nearest neighbor is always itself,
      *>>   training_accuracy()/confusion_matrix()
      *>> report leave-one-out performance rather than a trivial
      *>>   resubstitution fit.
       01 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW.
      *>> Arguments to send: 2 to 6 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 2.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              2.
      *>> data (const DataFrame &): DATA-FRAME handle.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-DATA USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> formula (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
      *>>   trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA PIC X(256).
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG
              SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> k (std::size_t = 5): unsigned long.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-K USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> metric (const std::string & = "euclidean"): text in PIC
      *>>   X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. "euclidean"
      *>>   (default) or "manhattan".
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-METRIC PIC X(256).
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-METRIC-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG
              SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> weighted (bool = false): 0 or 1.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-WEIGHTED USAGE BINARY-CHAR UNSIGNED.
      *>> standardize (bool = true): 0 or 1.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-STANDARDIZE USAGE BINARY-CHAR
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result: KNN-CLASSIFIER handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::KNNClassifier::classes() const ->
      *>>   std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_knn_classifier_classes" USING
      *>>   DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CLASSES DM-STATUS
       01 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CLASSES.
      *>> Self: the KNN-CLASSIFIER handle.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CLASSES-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::vector<std::string>): VECTOR-STRING handle (new;
      *>>   close it).
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-CLASSES-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

