              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> x_feature (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH
      *>>   -1 trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-X-FEATURE PIC X(256).
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-CLASSIFICATION-X-FEATURE-LENGTH
              USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> y_feature (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH
