      *>>   datamunge::graphics::RPlot
      *>> CALL "dm_knn_classifier_plot_decision_regions" USING
      *>>   DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Background grid of predicted class regions plus training
      *>>   points; requires exactly 2 predictors.
       01 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS.
      *>> Self: the KNN-CLASSIFIER handle.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-SELF USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Arguments to send: 2 to 3 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 2.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-GIVEN USAGE
              BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 2.
      *>> x_feature (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH
      *>>   -1 trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-X-FEATURE PIC
              X(256).
          05 DM-KNN-CLSSFR-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-X-FEATURE-LENGTH USAGE
              BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> y_feature (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH
      *>>   -1 trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-KNN-CLASSIFIER-PLOT-DECISION-REGIONS-Y-FEATURE PIC
