      *>>   VECTOR-STRING handle.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_clusters (std::size_t = 8): unsigned long.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-N-CLUSTERS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> max_iterations (std::size_t = 300): unsigned long.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-MAX-ITERATIONS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_init (std::size_t = 10): unsigned long.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-N-INIT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> tolerance (double = 1.0E-4): double.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-TOLERANCE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> seed (std::size_t = 42): unsigned long.
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-SEED USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result: K-MEANS handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-K-MEANS-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

