      *>>   std::string & metric = "euclidean") -> ISOMAP handle
      *>> CALL "dm_isomap_new" USING DM-ISOMAP-NEW DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::Isomap. Close the handle with CALL
      *>>   "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::stats::Isomap —
      *>>   nonlinear manifold learning via
      *>> geodesic (shortest-path, over a k-nearest-neighbor graph)
