      *>> Arguments to send: 2 to 5 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 2.
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 2.
      *>> data (const DataFrame &): DATA-FRAME handle.
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-DATA USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> feature_columns (const std::vector<std::string> &):
      *>>   VECTOR-STRING handle.
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_components (std::size_t = 2): unsigned long.
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-N-COMPONENTS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_neighbors (std::size_t = 10): unsigned long.
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-N-NEIGHBORS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> metric (const std::string & = "euclidean"): text in PIC
      *>>   X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. One of "euclidean"
      *>>   (default) or "manhattan".
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-METRIC PIC X(256).
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-METRIC-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE
              -1.
      *>> Result: ISOMAP handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-ISOMAP-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

