          05 DM-LLE-NEW-FEATURE-COLUMNS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_components (std::size_t = 2): unsigned long.
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-N-COMPONENTS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> n_neighbors (std::size_t = 10): unsigned long.
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-N-NEIGHBORS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> regularization (double = 0.001): double.
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-REGULARIZATION USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> metric (const std::string & = "euclidean"): text in PIC
      *>>   X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. One of "euclidean"
      *>>   (default) or "manhattan".
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-METRIC PIC X(256).
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-METRIC-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> Result: LLE handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-LLE-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

