      *>> perplexity (double = 30.0): double.
          05 DM-TSNE-NEW-PERPLEXITY USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> max_iterations (std::size_t = 1000): unsigned long.
          05 DM-TSNE-NEW-MAX-ITERATIONS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
