              USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> alpha (double = 0.5): double.
          05 DM-DFFSN-MPS-NEW-DATA-FRM-STRNG-ULNG-DBL-DBL-DBL-ALPHA
              USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> diffusion_time (double = 1.0): double.
          05 DM-DFF-MPS-NEW-DAT-FRM-STRN-ULNG-DBL-DBL-DBL-DFFSN-TIME
              USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result: DIFFUSION-MAPS handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-DFFSN-MPS-NEW-DATA-FRM-STRNG-ULNG-DBL-DBL-DBL-RESULT
              USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

