              UNSIGNED.
      *>> learning_rate (double = 0.29999999999999999): double.
          05 DM-SAMMON-MAPPING-NEW-LEARNING-RATE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> max_iterations (std::size_t = 500): unsigned long.
          05 DM-SAMMON-MAPPING-NEW-MAX-ITERATIONS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> tolerance (double = 1.0000000000000001E-9): double.
          05 DM-SAMMON-MAPPING-NEW-TOLERANCE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> metric (const std::string & = "euclidean"): text in PIC
      *>>   X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. One of "euclidean"
      *>>   (default) or "manhattan".
