              VALUE 2.
      *>> data (const DataFrame &): DATA-FRAME handle.
          05 DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-DATA USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> formula (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
      *>>   trims trailing spaces.
          05 DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-FORMULA PIC X(256).
