          05 DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-LEARNING-RATE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> max_depth (std::size_t = 6): unsigned long.
          05 DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-MAX-DEPTH USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> lambda (double = 1.0): double.
          05 DM-XG-BOOST-CLASSIFIER-NEW-LAMBDA USAGE COMP-2.
