      *>>   initially 1.
          05 DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-GIVEN USAGE
              BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 1.
      *>> newdata (const DataFrame &): DATA-FRAME handle.
          05 DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-NEWDATA USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> interval_kind (const std::string & = "none"): text in PIC
      *>>   X(256); -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. One of "none" or
      *>>   "confidence". Returned DataFrame has a "fit" column, plus
      *>>   "se_fit"/"lwr"/"upr" when an interval is requested.
          05 DM-GSSN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-INTERVAL-KIND PIC
              X(256).
          05 DM-GSSN-PRCSS-RGRSSN-PREDICT-FRAME-INTERVAL-KIND-LENGTH
              USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE -1.
      *>> level (double = 0.94999999999999996): double.
          05 DM-GAUSSIAN-PROCESS-REGRESSION-PREDICT-FRAME-LEVEL USAGE
              COMP-2.
