          05 DM-DUAL-ADD-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Dual::subtract(const Dual & other) const -> Dual
      *>> CALL "dm_dual_subtract" USING DM-DUAL-SUBTRACT DM-STATUS
