      *>> other (const Dual &): DUAL handle. Right operand.
          05 DM-DUAL-DIVIDE-OTHER USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Dual): DUAL handle (new; close it). A new Dual;
      *>>   neither operand changes.
          05 DM-DUAL-DIVIDE-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

