      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   VAR

      *>> datamunge::Var::Var(Tape & tape, double value) -> VAR handle
      *>> CALL "dm_var_new" USING DM-VAR-NEW DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> C++ class datamunge::Var. Close the handle with CALL
      *>>   "dm_close".
      *>>
      *>> SWIG-friendly facade for datamunge::autodiff::Var -- a handle
      *>>   into a Tape.
      *>>
      *>> Records a new independent leaf variable on `tape`.
       01 DM-VAR-NEW.
      *>> tape (Tape &): TAPE handle. The tape that records this
      *>>   variable and every expression built from it; it must outlive
      *>>   the Var, and operands of one expression must share it.
          05 DM-VAR-NEW-TAPE USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (double): double. The leaf's value.
          05 DM-VAR-NEW-VALUE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result: VAR handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-VAR-NEW-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::value() const -> double
      *>> CALL "dm_var_value" USING DM-VAR-VALUE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> The value of this node.
       01 DM-VAR-VALUE.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-VALUE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (double): double.
          05 DM-VAR-VALUE-RESULT USAGE COMP-2.

      *>> datamunge::Var::index() const -> std::size_t
      *>> CALL "dm_var_index" USING DM-VAR-INDEX DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> This node's index on its Tape: where to read its gradient in
      *>>   Tape::backward()'s result.
       01 DM-VAR-INDEX.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-INDEX-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::size_t): unsigned long.
          05 DM-VAR-INDEX-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::add(const Var & other) const -> Var
      *>> CALL "dm_var_add" USING DM-VAR-ADD DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Sum: this + `other`, with the node recorded on the shared
      *>>   Tape.
       01 DM-VAR-ADD.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-ADD-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> other (const Var &): VAR handle. Right operand (recorded on
      *>>   the same Tape).
          05 DM-VAR-ADD-OTHER USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Var): VAR handle (new; close it). A new Var; neither
      *>>   operand changes.
          05 DM-VAR-ADD-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::subtract(const Var & other) const -> Var
      *>> CALL "dm_var_subtract" USING DM-VAR-SUBTRACT DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Difference: this - `other`, with the node recorded on the
      *>>   shared Tape.
