      *>> Cosine (radians), with its exact chain-rule derivative.
       01 DM-VAR-COS.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-COS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Var): VAR handle (new; close it). A new Var.
          05 DM-VAR-COS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::tan() const -> Var
      *>> CALL "dm_var_tan" USING DM-VAR-TAN DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Tangent (radians), with its exact chain-rule derivative.
       01 DM-VAR-TAN.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-TAN-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Var): VAR handle (new; close it). A new Var.
          05 DM-VAR-TAN-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::tanh() const -> Var
      *>> CALL "dm_var_tanh" USING DM-VAR-TANH DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Hyperbolic tangent, with its exact chain-rule derivative.
       01 DM-VAR-TANH.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-TANH-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Var): VAR handle (new; close it). A new Var.
          05 DM-VAR-TANH-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::Var::abs() const -> Var
      *>> CALL "dm_var_abs" USING DM-VAR-ABS DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Absolute value |x| (the derivative at 0 uses the x ≥ 0
      *>>   branch), with its exact chain-rule derivative.
       01 DM-VAR-ABS.
      *>> Self: the VAR handle.
          05 DM-VAR-ABS-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Var): VAR handle (new; close it). A new Var.
