      *>> Self: the CAD-SCENE handle.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-SET-JOINT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> name (const std::string &): text in PIC X(256); -LENGTH -1
      *>>   trims trailing spaces. Joint name.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-SET-JOINT-NAME PIC X(256).
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-SET-JOINT-NAME-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED
              VALUE -1.
      *>> Value (double): double. Coordinate in radians/metres, within
      *>>   limits.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-SET-JOINT-VALUE USAGE COMP-2.

      *>> datamunge::cad::View::joint_names() const ->
      *>>   std::vector<std::string>
      *>> CALL "dm_cad_scene_joint_names" USING DM-CAD-SCENE-JOINT-NAMES
