      *>> - std::invalid_argument: Invalid camera.
       01 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA.
      *>> Self: the CAD-SCENE handle.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> x (double): double. Camera X position.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-X USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> y (double): double. Camera Y position.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-Y USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> z (double): double. Camera Z position.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-Z USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> target_x (double): double. Target X.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-TARGET-X USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> target_y (double): double. Target Y.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-TARGET-Y USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> target_z (double): double. Target Z; all values finite, target
      *>>   distinct and view not parallel to +Z.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-CAMERA-TARGET-Z USAGE COMP-2.

