      *>> datamunge::cad::View::light(double x, double y, double z,
      *>>   const std::string & color = "#ffffff", double intensity =
      *>>   1.0) -> int
      *>> CALL "dm_cad_scene_light" USING DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Add a directional light; the first explicit light replaces the
      *>>   fallback light.
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> dm::cad::View view; view.light(1,-2,3,"#ffffff",1.2);
      *>> ```
