      *>> Errors (a non-zero status):
      *>> - std::invalid_argument: Invalid direction, color or
      *>>   intensity.
       01 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT.
      *>> Self: the CAD-SCENE handle.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Arguments to send: 3 to 5 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 3.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 3.
      *>> x (double): double. Direction X from surface toward light.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-X USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> y (double): double. Direction Y.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-Y USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> z (double): double. Direction Z; finite nonzero vector.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-Z USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> color (const std::string & = "#ffffff"): text in PIC X(256);
      *>>   -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces. Hex RGB/RGBA light color,
      *>>   default white; alpha unused.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-COLOR PIC X(256).
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-COLOR-LENGTH USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED
              VALUE -1.
      *>> intensity (double = 1.0): double. Nonnegative finite
      *>>   multiplier, default 1.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-INTENSITY USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result (int): int. New light ID.
          05 DM-CAD-SCENE-LIGHT-RESULT USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED.

