      *>> datamunge::fda::HierarchicalBSpline::locate(const
      *>>   std::vector<double> & point) const -> int
      *>> CALL "dm_hierarchical_b_spline_locate" USING
      *>>   DM-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-LOCATE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Deepest existing cell containing `point`.
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> dm::fda::HierarchicalBSpline h({0.0}, {1.0});
      *>> int c = h.refine(h.root(), 1);
      *>> std::print("{} {}\n", h.locate({0.9}) == c, h.locate({2.0}));
      *>>   // true -1
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> Errors (a non-zero status):
      *>> - std::invalid_argument: If point.size() != dimensions().
       01 DM-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-LOCATE.
      *>> Self: the HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE handle.
          05 DM-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-LOCATE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> point (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE handle. d
      *>>   coordinates.
          05 DM-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-LOCATE-POINT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (int): int. Cell id, or -1 if `point` is outside the
      *>>   domain.
          05 DM-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-LOCATE-RESULT USAGE BINARY-LONG
              SIGNED.

