      *>> datamunge::fda::TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline::refine(int cell,
      *>>   int slot) -> int
      *>> CALL "dm_truncated_hierarchical_b_spline_refine" USING
      *>>   DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-REFINE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Creates (if needed) the child of `cell` at `slot`,
      *>>   materializing the next
      *>> level when first reached. The represented function is
      *>>   unchanged.
