      *>> datamunge::fda::TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline::is_active(int
      *>>   level, const std::vector<int> & index) const -> bool
      *>> CALL "dm_truncated_hierarchical_b_spline_is_active" USING
      *>>   DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Whether level- `level` function `index` is in the THB basis
      *>>   (support in
      *>> Omega^level but not in Omega^(level+1)).
      *>>
      *>> **Example**
      *>>
      *>> ```cpp
      *>> auto b = dm::fda::BSplineBasis::open_uniform(1, 2);
      *>> dm::fda::TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline
      *>>   thb(dm::fda::TensorBSpline(b, {0.0, 1.0}));
      *>> thb.subdivide(thb.root());
      *>> std::print("{} {}\n", thb.is_active(0, {0}), thb.is_active(1,
      *>>   {0})); // false true
      *>> ```
      *>>
      *>> Errors (a non-zero status):
      *>> - std::out_of_range: For invalid levels/indices.
      *>> - std::invalid_argument: On a dimension mismatch.
       01 DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE.
      *>> Self: the TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE handle.
          05 DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE-SELF USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> level (int): int. Level.
          05 DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE-LEVEL USAGE
              BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
      *>> index (const std::vector<int> &): VECTOR-INT handle.
      *>>   Multi-index.
          05 DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE-INDEX USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (bool): 0 or 1. Activity flag.
          05 DM-TRUNCATED-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-IS-ACTIVE-RESULT USAGE
              BINARY-CHAR UNSIGNED.

