      *>> index (const std::vector<int> &): VECTOR-INT handle. Active
      *>>   multi-index.
          05 DM-TRNCTD-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-SET-COEFFICIENT-INDEX USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (double): double. New coefficient.
          05 DM-TRNCTD-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-SET-COEFFICIENT-VALUE USAGE
              COMP-2.

      *>> datamunge::fda::TruncatedHierarchicalBSpline::truncated_basis(int
