              BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
      *>> index (const std::vector<int> &): VECTOR-INT handle.
      *>>   Multi-index (inactive functions give 0).
          05 DM-TRNCTD-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-TRUNCATED-BASIS-INDEX USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> point (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE handle. d
      *>>   coordinates inside the domain.
          05 DM-TRNCTD-HIERARCHICAL-B-SPLINE-TRUNCATED-BASIS-POINT USAGE
              BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
