      *>>   statistics (and
      *>> updates batch-norm moving averages).
       01 DM-NN-MODEL-FORWARD.
      *>> Self: the NN-MODEL handle.
          05 DM-NN-MODEL-FORWARD-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Arguments to send: 1 to 2 (C++ defaults fill the rest);
      *>>   initially 1.
          05 DM-NN-MODEL-FORWARD-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 1.
