      *>>   initially 2.
          05 DM-NN-MODEL-LOSS-GIVEN USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED VALUE 2.
      *>> x (const NnTensor &): NN-TENSOR handle.
          05 DM-NN-MODEL-LOSS-X USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> y (const NnTensor &): NN-TENSOR handle.
          05 DM-NN-MODEL-LOSS-Y USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> loss (const std::string & = "mse"): text in PIC X(256);
      *>>   -LENGTH -1 trims trailing spaces.
