      *>> Self: the TASK-OUTPUT handle.
          05 DM-TASK-OUTPUT-TERMINATED-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.
      *>> Value (std::vector<std::uint8_t>): VECTOR-UCHAR handle (new;
      *>>   refers into its owner, which it keeps alive).
          05 DM-TASK-OUTPUT-TERMINATED-VALUE USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE
              UNSIGNED.

      *>> std::vector<std::uint8_t>
