      *> ----------------------------------------------------------------
      *>   TASK-BATCH

      *>> datamunge::sim::TaskBatch::size() const -> std::size_t
      *>> CALL "dm_task_batch_size" USING DM-TASK-BATCH-SIZE DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Return the number of independent environments.
