      *>> Self: the TASK-BATCH handle.
          05 DM-TASK-BATCH-SIZE-SELF USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (std::size_t): unsigned long. Positive environment
      *>>   count.
          05 DM-TASK-BATCH-SIZE-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::sim::TaskBatch::observation_size() const ->
      *>>   std::size_t
      *>> CALL "dm_task_batch_observation_size" USING
      *>>   DM-TASK-BATCH-OBSERVATION-SIZE DM-STATUS
