          05 DM-FACTOR-OVER-REALS-CONJUGATE-TOLERANCE USAGE COMP-2.
      *>> Result (RealFactorization): REAL-FACTORIZATION handle (new;
      *>>   close it).
          05 DM-FACTOR-OVER-REALS-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::algebra::detail::total_degree(const
      *>>   std::vector<int> & exponents) -> int
