      *>> ys (const std::vector<double> &): VECTOR-DOUBLE handle.
          05 DM-NEWTON-INTERPOLATE-YS USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> Result (Polynomial): POLYNOMIAL handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-NEWTON-INTERPOLATE-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

