      *>> datamunge::algebra::expected_distinct_irreducible_factors(long
      *>>   long p, int n) -> double
      *>> CALL "dm_expected_distinct_irreducible_factors" USING
      *>>   DM-EXPECTED-DISTINCT-IRREDUCIBLE-FACTORS DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> Expected number of distinct monic irreducible factors of a
      *>>   uniformly random monic
      *>> polynomial of degree `n` over GF(p): each irreducible g of
      *>>   degree d <= n divides it with
      *>> probability
