      *>> gradients Ix/Iy, their per-pixel outer product Ix^2/Iy^2/IxIy,
      *>>   then smoothed with a
      *>> Gaussian window of the given `sigma` -- the shared computation
      *>>   behind both Harris
      *>> and Shi-Tomasi corner response, which differ only in how they
      *>>   combine these three
      *>> fields into a single scalar score.
