      *>> Result (Image): IMAGE handle (new; close it).
          05 DM-CROP-RESULT USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

      *>> datamunge::image::flip_horizontal(const Image & src) -> Image
      *>> CALL "dm_flip_horizontal" USING DM-FLIP-HORIZONTAL DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> A new image with every row reversed left-to-right (mirror
