      *>> datamunge::image::rotate90(const Image & src, int degrees) ->
      *>>   Image
      *>> CALL "dm_rotate90" USING DM-ROTATE90 DM-STATUS
      *>>
      *>> A new image rotated clockwise by exactly 90, 180, or 270
      *>>   degrees (any other value
      *>> throws std::invalid_argument -- use rotate() for arbitrary
      *>>   angles). 90/270 swap
      *>> width and height; 180 keeps them.
