      *>> src (const Image &): IMAGE handle.
          05 DM-ROTATE90-SRC USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
      *>> degrees (int): int.
          05 DM-ROTATE90-DEGREES USAGE BINARY-LONG SIGNED.
      *>> Result (Image): IMAGE handle (new; close it).
